<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20797] P1: SET/CLEAR I/O scope ioctl</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20797</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name="Summary"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Summary&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add &lt;tt&gt;struct ll_ioc_io_scope&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;LL_IOC_SET_IO_SCOPE&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;LL_IOC_CLEAR_IO_SCOPE&lt;/tt&gt; on master. Define all four scopes; implement &lt;tt&gt;FILE&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;MIRROR&lt;/tt&gt;; &lt;tt&gt;STRIPE&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;OBJECT&lt;/tt&gt; return &lt;tt&gt;-EOPNOTSUPP&lt;/tt&gt; at the ioctl and are not stored.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name="Description"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Description&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Freeze the UAPI in the first patch (field layout, not every scope's semantics). This replaces the FLR designated-mirror ioctl as the extensible target-selection interface. &lt;tt&gt;LL_IOC_FLR_SET_MIRROR&lt;/tt&gt; stays as an alias for {MIRROR, mirror_id}.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;ios_comp_id&lt;/tt&gt; stays in the struct for STRIPE / OBJECT (opened in P1b / P2). P1 FILE / MIRROR require it to be 0. &lt;tt&gt;ios_stripe_idx&lt;/tt&gt; is documented as relative among objects sharing this file offset (opened in P1b). &lt;tt&gt;ios_fid&lt;/tt&gt; is OBJECT's sole identity (opened in P2).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Unknown scope, non-zero flags / padding, or unused identity fields → &lt;tt&gt;&lt;del&gt;EINVAL&lt;/tt&gt;. Non&lt;/del&gt;&lt;tt&gt;FILE&lt;/tt&gt; scopes require &lt;tt&gt;O_DIRECT&lt;/tt&gt;. No lov / cl_object changes: &lt;tt&gt;ll_io_set_scope()&lt;/tt&gt; only ever sees &lt;tt&gt;FILE&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;MIRROR&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Userspace: &lt;tt&gt;llapi_io_scope_set/clear&lt;/tt&gt;. &lt;tt&gt;llapi_mirror_set/clear&lt;/tt&gt; keep their signatures and still issue &lt;tt&gt;SET_MIRROR&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Prefer landing in the same Gerrit topic as &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20534" title="FLR-EC: Stripe replacement: swapping individual stripes between components" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20534"&gt;LU-20534&lt;/a&gt; or the EC series.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name="Acceptance"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Acceptance&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Existing non-EC &lt;tt&gt;lfs mirror resync/verify&lt;/tt&gt; behaviour is unchanged.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;SET_MIRROR&lt;/tt&gt; alias still works (&lt;tt&gt;llapi_mirror_set&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;lfs mirror resync&lt;/tt&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;STRIPE&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;OBJECT&lt;/tt&gt; → &lt;tt&gt;-EOPNOTSUPP&lt;/tt&gt;; not stored on the fd.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Non-zero padding / flags / unused identity fields / unknown scope / non-&lt;tt&gt;O_DIRECT&lt;/tt&gt; MIRROR → &lt;tt&gt;-EINVAL&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;No lov / &lt;tt&gt;cl_object.h&lt;/tt&gt; changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
